BEHAVIOR iadd
DESCRIPTION
  Adds two 8-byte integers and returns the sum. Pure arithmetic helper so
  compositions (which may not compute) can obtain a derived length.
CONTRACT
  INPUT a int 8
  INPUT b int 8
  OUTPUT sum int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output
HASH 8b41ba23
IMPLEMENTATION
  va = LOAD a 8
  vb = LOAD b 8
  s = IADD va vb 8
  STORE sum s 8
END
